0 COUNTERTURN - internal flywheel, free external yaw
0 Name: counterturn.ldr
0 Author: CrispStrobe
0 !LICENSE BSD-3-Clause : see ../licenses/counterturn.txt
0 !LDRAW_ORG Unofficial_Model
0 // One hub, one horizontal motor, one right-angle flywheel, one passive yaw bearing.
0 // Gear seating and phase are construction data, never prescribed output motion.
0 // No hidden joints, ground anchors, custom collision rules or rotor trajectory.
0 // Battery45610 additional; route the integral cable entirely on the carrier.
0 // Right-angle drive adapted from Brickwright contributors bevel-12-20 fixture.
